Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:19.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She'll get the honors because she earned them.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N荣誉属于她 这是她赢来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:23.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She'll receive praise of which she is most deserving.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她将收获当之无愧的赞美
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:28.44,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}年前 她的世界排名跌到第{\fs78}532{\fs68}位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:29.17,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.17,0:00:32.20,TL,,0,0,0,,她捧起了武汉{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:36.54,TL,,0,0,0,,她出生在波兰南部的梅胡夫 两岁起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:39.81,TL,,0,0,0,,在煤矿城市达布罗瓦古尔尼恰长大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:41.71,TL,,0,0,0,,父亲在煤矿当过电工
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:44.26,TL,,0,0,0,,母亲在当地体育中心做前台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:46.86,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}岁那年 她就在那座体育中心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:49.05,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次拿起了球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:56.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalińska, mam 14 lat,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我是玛雅 赫瓦林斯卡 {\fs78}14{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:58.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}mieszkam w Dąbrowie Górniczej{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N住在达布罗瓦古尔尼恰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:04.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}i trenuję od 7 roku życia.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}7{\fs68}岁开始练球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.70,0:01:07.21,TL,,0,0,0,,她和同岁的斯瓦泰克从小搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:08.87,TL,,0,0,0,,拿过欧洲{\fs78}14{\fs68}岁组
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.87,0:01:11.12,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁组的女双冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年澳网青少年女双
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:15.77,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人拿了亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:20.43,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2019{\fs68}年底 她的心理开始出问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:23.86,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年{\fs78}10{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:26.03,TL,,0,0,0,,同岁的斯瓦泰克拿下法网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:29.32,TL,,0,0,0,,成了波兰第一个大满贯单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:34.95,TL,,0,0,0,,那时她手腕受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:38.12,TL,,0,0,0,,只能用软海绵球和小球拍练球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:41.16,TL,,0,0,0,,记者打来电话 问的全是伊加
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.16,0:01:44.00,TL,,0,0,0,,她后来说 我们同岁 她排得那么高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:47.28,TL,,0,0,0,,一直在拿冠军 那我在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:51.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You know, I pushed at the beginning.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一开始 我硬撑着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.10,0:01:55.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I thought that I just need to stay very strong, tough,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我以为只要够坚强 够硬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:56.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and just keep practicing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一直练下去就行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:01.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, but then I just couldn't get out of bed anymore.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可后来 我连床都下不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.06,0:02:05.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I was just lifeless, to be honest.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说实话 我整个人都没了生气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:09.73,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年 她在温网资格赛首轮输球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:11.45,TL,,0,0,0,,之后离开了赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.45,0:02:12.57,TL,,0,0,0,,几个月后回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:15.68,TL,,0,0,0,,世界排名已经掉到第{\fs78}346{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.95,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年 她第一次打进大满贯正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:22.27,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次公开讲自己的抑郁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.27,0:02:24.34,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月爬到第{\fs78}153{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:27.72,TL,,0,0,0,,接着右膝动了手术 赛季提前结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.07,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年{\fs78}8{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:32.02,TL,,0,0,0,,她的排名跌到第{\fs78}532{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:37.01,TL,,0,0,0,,她从更低级别的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:38.94,TL,,0,0,0,,一站一站往回打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.94,0:02:39.70,TL,,0,0,0,,红土上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:42.73,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿了{\fs78}3{\fs68}个 {\fs78}WTA{\fs68} 一二五的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:44.14,TL,,0,0,0,,今年{\fs78}2{\fs68}月在克鲁日
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:47.11,TL,,0,0,0,,她从资格赛一路打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:08.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}…wins in a row here for the qualifier Maja Chwalinska.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N资格赛选手赫瓦林斯卡连胜继续
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:12.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has seen off the seventh seed, Olga Danilovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她送走了七号种子达尼洛维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:18.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's finished here. 6-1, 1-6, 6-2.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well deserved.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N实至名归
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:25.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, my goal was to be top 100 this year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我今年的目标是进前{\fs78}100{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:26.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That was the main goal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是最主要的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:29.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Coming here, my goal was to qualify.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来这儿 我的目标是打进正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:31.70,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年法网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:33.86,TL,,0,0,0,,世界排名第{\fs78}114{\fs68}的她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:35.69,TL,,0,0,0,,先打{\fs78}3{\fs68}轮资格赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:36.64,TL,,0,0,0,,正赛首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:39.31,TL,,0,0,0,,她{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}赢了郑钦文
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:43.00,TL,,0,0,0,,接着又赢了梅尔滕斯 萨卡里 帕里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.76,TL,,0,0,0,,一/四决赛 她赢了卡林斯卡娅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.76,0:03:51.22,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次打进大满贯半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:54.21,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 她又赢了施奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:27.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Like a dream, honestly.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N老实说 像做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:29.16,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't know what's going on.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我都不知道发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:35.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, I don't know what to say.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm sorry, I'm just very happy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N抱歉 我就是太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:39.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No, I'm crazy sometimes also.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不 我有时候也会抓狂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:47.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But I try to stay composed,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我尽量保持镇定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:50.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it helps me to play my best tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这样才能打出最好的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.78,0:04:53.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's what I'm trying to do,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我一直在这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:56.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but inside there's a storm, believe me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可心里是一场风暴 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:59.10,TL,,0,0,0,,她成了法网历史上第一位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:05:01.41,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛打进决赛的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:03.12,TL,,0,0,0,,也是公开赛年代第二位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.98,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛打进大满贯女单决赛的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:09.45,TL,,0,0,0,,第一位是{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年美网的拉杜卡努
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.83,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 她{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:14.87,TL,,0,0,0,,输给了安德烈耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:18.32,TL,,0,0,0,,可这{\fs78}3{\fs68}周 让她的排名从第{\fs78}114{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.30,TL,,0,0,0,,升到了第{\fs78}21{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:25.16,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I wish you could see a better match today,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真希望你们今天能看场更好的球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:27.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but Mirra was just so good for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可米拉今天打得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:29.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I guess it's her fault.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以 我想这得怪她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:35.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, I tried my best. I'm sorry.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我尽力了 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:38.42,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}周后 温网首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:40.24,TL,,0,0,0,,她{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:43.60,TL,,0,0,0,,自己发球胜赛 {\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68} 赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:46.45,TL,,0,0,0,,她在底线滑倒 伤了右脚踝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:49.36,TL,,0,0,0,,她没有退赛 最后被资格赛选手翻盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:52.40,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:55.86,TL,,0,0,0,,一个多月后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:58.77,TL,,0,0,0,,多伦多的第一场 她又输了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.92,TL,,0,0,0,,直到{\fs78}8{\fs68}月中旬的辛辛那提
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:03.90,TL,,0,0,0,,她才赢下法网之后的第一场球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:07.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The ball goes long,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N球出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:11.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and the crowd that have been right behind Maja Chwalinska on court seven{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}7{\fs68}号场边一直为她加油的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:16.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}are very, very happy to see her go through to the third round.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看着她晋级第三轮 开心极了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:20.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was definitely a bit frustrating, you know.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那阵子确实有点憋屈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:22.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I had some good momentum going on,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我本来势头正好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:24.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but it's just sport, you know.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但体育就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:28.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You got to accept that it's brutal sometimes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你得接受 它有时候就是很残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:31.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, a lot of attention,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N关注多了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:33.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}definitely much more than before.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比以前多太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.51,0:06:35.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Before, I mean, no one really cared.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以前 说真的 没人在意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:39.22,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提下一轮 她输给施奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.22,0:06:41.44,TL,,0,0,0,,蒙特雷又是第一场出局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:45.67,TL,,0,0,0,,美网首轮 {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 输给汤森德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:49.27,TL,,0,0,0,,从法网决赛到美网 她{\fs78}1{\fs68}胜{\fs78}5{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:54.56,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月 她第一次打亚洲赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:56.92,TL,,0,0,0,,新加坡 她总算连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:58.44,TL,,0,0,0,,打进半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.95,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢下一盘之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:02.49,TL,,0,0,0,,又被费尔南德斯翻盘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:08.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}2{\fs68}日 北京第二轮 {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:10.07,TL,,0,0,0,,法网决赛之后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.07,0:07:12.80,TL,,0,0,0,,到武汉之前 她{\fs78}4{\fs68}胜{\fs78}7{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:16.10,TL,,0,0,0,,她后来说 那段时间外界对她很苛刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:18.29,TL,,0,0,0,,我也只是个普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:23.82,TL,,0,0,0,,两周后 武汉 半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:25.73,TL,,0,0,0,,又碰上斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:28.96,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 斯瓦泰克拿到两个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:31.26,TL,,0,0,0,,她一个一个救了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:48.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalinska does it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.79,0:07:50.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Perhaps the unthinkable for some,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N或许有人觉得不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.63,0:07:53.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but not for her, not for her camp.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她和她的团队并不这样想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.31,0:07:57.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Chwalinska hands Iga Swiatek her first dropped set in Wuhan{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克本届武汉第一次丢盘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:08:01.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and has the upper hand in semifinal number two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在第二场半决赛占得先机
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:05.37,TL,,0,0,0,,追到五平 她再破发到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:07.66,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克叫了医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:10.18,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}算起 最后{\fs78}11{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.97,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿了{\fs78}10{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:17.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She knows she's oh so close.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她知道胜利已经近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:19.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalinska. Match point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡来到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:24.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, Maja!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 玛雅！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:29.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Magnificence in Wuhan,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N武汉的精彩一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:32.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she topples her fellow Pole, former world number one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她击败同为波兰人的前世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:36.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for her first career top-10 win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N生涯第一次赢前{\fs78}10{\fs68}球员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:49.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's always tough to play against a fellow Polish player.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N和同胞交手 总是很难
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:51.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's a great champion,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她是伟大的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:53.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a living legend, she won everything.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N活着的传奇 什么都赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:56.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was a great honor for me to share the court with her today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天能和她同场 是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:09:01.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I still don't really realize what's going on,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我还没完全反应过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:04.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and the fact that I won against her is actually crazy for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赢了她 对我来说太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:06.63,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 她先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:08.74,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘又{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:11.89,TL,,0,0,0,,她追了回来 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 扳平
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:15.06,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:16.54,TL,,0,0,0,,她一局都没再丢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:18.62,TL,,0,0,0,,连拿了最后{\fs78}4{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:28.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalinska's first WTA title is a big one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡的首个巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.35,0:09:31.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's a WTA 1000 champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就是一座一千赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:35.06,TL,,0,0,0,,她成了{\fs78}2009{\fs68}年以来第四位
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:36.83,TL,,0,0,0,,生涯首个巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:38.89,TL,,0,0,0,,就是{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛冠军的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.61,TL,,0,0,0,,前{\fs78}3{\fs68}位是大坂直美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.61,0:09:42.84,TL,,0,0,0,,安德莱斯库和姆博科
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:46.39,TL,,0,0,0,,新一周 她会第一次进入世界前{\fs78}20{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:52.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the energy, it means a lot,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你们的能量 对我意义很大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:54.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so I really enjoyed my time here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我在这里过得特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.37,0:09:55.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was my first time as well,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是我第一次来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.77,0:09:58.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}definitely not the last.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但肯定不是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:10:00.66,TL,,0,0,0,,那几年 她一直在问自己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:02.00,TL,,0,0,0,,我在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.48,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 答案写在了武汉的领奖台上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:08.71,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}532{\fs68}到{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛冠军 你觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:11.10,TL,,0,0,0,,是什么让她打了出来？
